    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuvoya kwa Hosea kwa wundu ghwa Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee wandu wa Israeli, wuyenyi kwa BWANA Mlungu onyu, kwa kukaia mookuwishwa ni makosa ghenyu gheni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuyenyi kwa BWANA na ilombi iji, “Kudifuye wughoma kaung'a redu, kudirumirie ilombi jedu nesi dichakukasa seji derelaghirieghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashuru ndechaadikira, hata farasi ra wuda nderichaaditesia. Ndediwuyaaghora sena kwa milimu, iyo kazi ya mikonu yedu, wei ni milungu yedu. Ee BWANA, kuwiwonie wughoma awo wisewadie weke ndee.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "BWANA kulaghira irangi iwishi kwa Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malagho ghemeria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo wiko na hikima ndewitambukilo ni agho ghiandikilo na aha, wighingire ngolonyi. Chia ra BWANA ni ra loli, na wandu wa hachi wichadua kwa kurinugha iro; wakaung'a wichakuwa na kughwa kwa kulegharinugha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
